    <item>
      <title>ChatGPT要变“AgentGPT”？史上最大改版来袭，从聊到做，OpenAI要搞超级应用</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/chatgptagentgptopenai-20260608154004656-3/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jun 2026 15:40:04 +0800</pubDate>
